deId":732790711,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4292,"speakerName":"マシーラ","textMapHash":105268866,"text":"罠は君が仕掛けるものだ。","nextNodeIds":[732790712]},{"nodeId":732790712,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4292,"speakerName":"マシーラ","textMapHash":1646112514,"text":"捕るべき獲物に逆に捕られるとは、猟鷹であるというのに恥ずかしくないのか…","nextNodeIds":[732790713]},{"nodeId":732790713,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20842,"speakerName":"タッドラー","textMapHash":2168180658,"text":"……","nextNodeIds":[732790714]},{"nodeId":732790714,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4292,"speakerName":"マシーラ","textMapHash":537107034,"text":"…少し休め、今は休んだほうがいい。あとで怪我の手当をしよう。","nextNodeIds":[732790715]},{"nodeId":732790715,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"暗転","textMapHash":3848399274,"text":"タッドラーはただ黙って頷き、痛みを我慢しながらゆっくり離れていった。","nextNodeIds":[732790716]},{"nodeId":732790716,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":441317450,"text":"マシーラはタッドラーにちょっと厳しいな…","nextNodeIds":[732790717,732790720]},{"nodeId":732790717,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":703655626,"text":"#{M#君}{F#あなた}たちの関係は…悪いの？","nextNodeIds":[732790718]},{"nodeId":732790718,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4292,"speakerName":"マシーラ","textMapHash":2809803002,"text":"うん？いやいや、そんなわけないだろう！あの子は私の最愛の猟鷹だ…だが、決して溺愛するつもりはない。獲物の捕れない猟鷹を甘やかすわけにはいかないだろう？","nextNodeIds":[732790719]},{"nodeId":732790719,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20846,"speakerName":"リルパァール","textMapHash":3419162786,"text":"なるほど…あらあら、あの子、楽な生き方はできそうにないですわね。","nextNodeIds":[732790723]},{"nodeId":732790723,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4292,"speakerName":"マシーラ","textMapHash":682388002,"text":"これは君への報酬だ、ぜひとも受け取ってくれ。尊き「ジンニーの主」よ、感謝する。","nextNodeIds":[732790724]},{"nodeId":732790724,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20846,"speakerName":"リルパァール","textMapHash":2160436866,"text":"コホン、お礼の相手に漏れがあるのでは？あと二人いたような。","nextNodeIds":[732790725]},{"nodeId":732790725,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2039200810,"text":"ヘヘっ、その一人は「人」とは言えないけどな…","nextNodeIds":[732790726]},{"nodeId":732790726,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20846,"speakerName":"リルパァール","textMapHash":760345490,"text":"ああ…うっかりしていた。こちらのおチビちゃんは人間ではなかったのだったな。でも、私たちも感謝されるべきだろう？","nextNodeIds":[732790727]},{"nodeId":732790727,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":770711370,"text":"おいっ！","nextNodeIds":[732790728]},{"nodeId":732790728,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4292,"speakerName":"マシーラ","textMapHash":779593018,"text":"はっはっはっ、すまん、すまん。追加の報酬も受け取ってくれ。","nextNodeIds":[732790729]},{"nodeId":732790729,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1679733802,"text":"追加の報酬までくれるのか！","nextNodeIds":[732790730]},{"nodeId":732790730,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20846,"speakerName":"リルパァール","textMapHash":3823924994,"text":"…それでも物足りないけれど、我が主が納得なさるのなら、それでよしとしましょう。","nextNodeIds":[732790731]},{"nodeId":732790731,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4292,"speakerName":"マシーラ","textMapHash":316946122,"text":"なら、よかった。あっ…もし時間があるなら、もう一度来てくれないか…我が「猟鷹」には、まだ君の助けが必要なんだ。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":732790720,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2592856642,"text":"タッドラーをあまりいじめないで。","nextNodeIds":[732790721]},{"nodeId":732790721,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4292,"speakerName":"マシーラ","textMapHash":3103083610,"text":"いじめる？いや、私が甘やかしたせいで、あの子の腕は鈍ってしまったんだ…だから、教育しているだけさ。あの子は優秀な「猟鷹」だ。私がどうして傷づけるというんだ。","nextNodeIds":[732790722]},{"nodeId":732790722,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20846,"speakerName":"リルパァール","textMapHash":1936564906,"text":"猟鷹はどんな結末を迎えるのか…","nextNodeIds":[732790723]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7327907,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[{"LNHLPKELCAL":["133307121"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_UNREGISTER_DYNAM